Third-party notices
===================

excal-mode is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3
or later (see LICENSE).  Parts of it are ports of the following
projects, whose licenses require these notices.

Excalidraw (https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw)
  Element model, rendering rules, binding, elbow-arrow routing, text
  layout, restore/migration, export, flowchart and tool behaviour, and
  the bundled @excalidraw/laser-pointer.  Ported throughout the Elisp
  sources and src/.

roughjs 4.6.4 (https://github.com/rough-stuff/rough)
  The hand-drawn stroke and fill generator.  Ported in src/excal-rough.c
  and src/excal-shape.c.

perfect-freehand 1.2.0 (https://github.com/steveruizok/perfect-freehand)
  Pressure-sensitive freedraw outlines.  Ported in src/excal-freehand.c.

fractional-indexing (https://github.com/rocicorp/fractional-indexing)
  Order-key generation, dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 by
  David Greenspan and Rocicorp.  Ported in excal-index.el.

Fonts fetched by `make fonts' are not part of this repository; they
keep their own licenses (SIL Open Font License for Excalifont, Nunito,
Lilita One, Comic Shanns, Xiaolai; see fonts/README).

